{"unit_id":"tag:0F1C:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为域（fields）的扩张（extension）。设<MATH_0002>为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的态射（morphism），在<MATH_0003>上的概形（schemes）之间。用<MATH_0004>表示基变换（base change），即将<MATH_0005>变换到<MATH_0006>上的结果。设<MATH_0007>具有上同调层（cohomology sheaves），其茎（stalks）为挠（torsion）的，阶（orders）在<MATH_0008>中可逆（invertible）。设<MATH_0009>为拉回（pullback），即将<MATH_0010>拉到<MATH_0011>上的结果。则<MATH_0012>为拉回（pullback），即将<MATH_0013>拉到<MATH_0014>上的结果。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠"},{"source_term":"orders","target_term":"阶"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"域","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"orders","target_term":"阶","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"